    "body": "I've added a `dbg!` here:\r\n```rust\r\nmatch Command::new(\"python\").arg(\"--version\").output() {\r\n    Ok(output) => {\r\n        dbg!(&output);\r\n        Some(String::from_utf8(output.stdout).unwrap())\r\n    },\r\n    Err(_) => None,\r\n}\r\n```\r\nand this is what I get:\r\n```bash\r\n[src/modules/python.rs:50] &output = Output {\r\n    status: ExitStatus(\r\n        ExitStatus(\r\n            0\r\n        )\r\n    ),\r\n    stdout: \"\",\r\n    stderr: \"Python 2.7.15rc1\\n\"\r\n}\r\n```",
